Harry has to settle the legal status of a woman ([[Marcia Rodd]]) who remarried after her first husband Mitch Bowers ([[Charles Napier (actor)|Charles Napier]]) was mistakenly declared dead, and who wants her back even though she is now seeing another man ([[Basil Hoffman]]).

''Note'': D.D. Howard appears as court clerk Charley Tracy. [[Milt Kogan]] appears as a doctor. Paula Kelly makes her final appearance as public defender Liz Williams.
